</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428508\">K47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a) and remove the cam angle sensor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043977.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the cam angle sensor back in its\nhousing and fix it using the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\ncam angle sensor.</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the cam angle sensor back in its\nhousing and fix it using the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\ncam angle sensor.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the cam angle sensor back in its\nhousing and fix it using the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\ncam angle sensor.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n       